8014878,2023-12-18,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",Virtual currency,Fraud or scam,,"On XX/XX/XXXX, while in a foreign country I was drugged and my phone was stolen and hacked. Multiple accounts have been breached and accessed. When I attempted to regain access to my XXXX XXXX account on the following day, I got an error message saying that my login information was not recognized. I tried to regain access by requesting a reset link to be sent to my email. I got an online response that it was sent but the link never came. At that point I attempted to call XXXX XXXX at their published number XXXX. The automated message said that the only way to get customer service was to request a call back from the app. However I could not login into the app, because the thieves altered the login info and changed the email and phone number linked to the account. In essence : There was absolutely no way for me to contact XXXX XXXX to report the breach and freeze the account. 

