8051711,2023-12-23,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account status incorrect,"I have diligently corresponded with Equifax, XXXX, and XXXX, highlighting numerous inaccuracies in my consumer credit profile, including erroneous late payment reports. XXXX and Equifax is reporting inaccurate payment history to my consumer report. XXXX is not reporting the same information that XXXX and Equifax is reporting inaccurate concerning a XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX. This account is paid off in full and no late payments should be reporting to my consumer credit profile concerning this account. Below I have attached documents as proof. 

