8053363,2023-12-25,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",International money transfer,Fraud or scam,,"I recently found myself entangled in what appears to be an elaborate scam. Despite my persistent efforts to contact the company involved and to settle the dispute with the payment provider PayPal through which I initiated the transfers to the fraudulent entity, I have encountered no help or solutions.

