Provide me with information regarding my right to opt out of having my information shared with furnishers in the future. 
I am enclosing copies of my credit reports and any relevant documentation supporting my claims. Please confirm receipt of this letter and outline the steps you will take to address my concerns. I reserve all further rights and remedies available under the FCRA and applicable laws. Equifax and XXXX do not maintain reasonable procedures. Also 12 CFR 1016.7 states that A consumer may exercise the right to opt out at any time. 
I am opting out of your reporting services. 
Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter.",,"EQUIFAX, INC.",FL,33334,,Web,2023-12-27,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes
